The program aims to insulate existing homes faster, smarter and more socially. The program focuses on the insulation of homes with the worst energy labels (E, F and G) via a multi-year target group-oriented approach. We also offer residents of Nijmegen.
Customized support along 4 lines of action:
1) Owner-occupied homes with low incomes with an area-oriented approach below
municipality management;
2) Rental properties;
3) Purchase of homes on one's own initiative;
4) Quickly save on your energy bill with simple measures.

column23:
The “Sustainable Development Strategy of Brașov Municipality 2010-2030” represents a framework for development and a tool for the local public administration in implementing the vision and strategic development objectives.

The strategy's drafting process is based on four studies:

1. The socio-structural analysis of the current situation;
2. The evaluation report of public opinion surveys conducted in Brașov Municipality in March 2011;
3. The demographic forecast regarding the evolution of the population until the year 2030;
4. The SWOT analysis, through which the city's strengths and weaknesses are described for the purpose of developing the Brașov 2030 Strategy.

